    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>A fine-grained limestone, or soft, earthy form of calcium carbonate; used chiefly in putty, crayons, paint, rubber products, linoleum, and as a pigment and abrasive. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
